{"id":104,"name":"cubone","speciesId":104,"dex":104,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["ground"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":50,"defense":95,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":50,"speed":35},"abilities":[{"name":"rock-head","hidden":false},{"name":"lightning-rod","hidden":false},{"name":"battle-armor","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":65,"baseExp":64,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/104.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/104.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/104.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/104.ogg","genus":"Lonely Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon solitário","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this POKéMON's real face."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Wears the skull of its deceased mother. Its cries echo inside the skull and come out as a sad melody."},{"version":"gold","text":"If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes, and emits a plain­ tive and mournful sound."},{"version":"silver","text":"It always wears the skull of its dead mother, so no one has any idea what its hidden face looks like."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It lost its mother after its birth. It wears its mother's skull, never revealing its true face."},{"version":"ruby","text":"CUBONE pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the POKéMON wears are made by the tears it sheds."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull it wears are from its tears."},{"version":"firered","text":"It wears the skull of its dead mother on its head. When it becomes lonesome, it is said to cry loudly."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Because it never removes its skull helmet, no one has ever seen this POKéMON’s real face."},{"version":"diamond","text":"When it thinks of its dead mother, it cries. Its crying makes the skull it wears rattle hollowly."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"If it is sad or lonely, the skull it wears shakes and emits a plaintive and mournful sound."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cubone pines for the mother it will never see again. Seeing a likeness of its mother in the full moon, it cries. The stains on the skull the Pokémon wears are made by the tears it sheds."},{"version":"sun","text":"When it thinks of its deceased mother, it weeps loudly. Mandibuzz that hear its cries will attack it from the air."},{"version":"moon","text":"The skull it wears on its head is that of its dead mother. According to some, it will evolve when it comes to terms with the pain of her death."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"At night, it weeps loudly for its dead mother, but those cries only attract its natural enemy—Mandibuzz."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It wears its mother’s skull on its head, so no one knows what its bare face looks like. However, it’s clear that it’s always crying."},{"version":"sword","text":"When the memory of its departed mother brings it to tears, its cries echo mournfully within the skull it wears on its head."},{"version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon wears the skull of its deceased mother. Sometimes Cubone’s dreams make it cry, but each tear Cubone sheds makes it stronger."}],"flavorPt":"Este Pokémon usa a caveira de sua falecida mãe. Às vezes, os sonhos de Cubone o fazem chorar, mas cada lágrima que Cubone derrama o torna mais forte.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["monster"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"cubone","speciesId":104,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 28","Nível 28, À noite"],"species":"marowak","speciesId":105,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{